173:- **Playwright** (`e2e/`, `@playwright/test` via npm, the only Node dependency): dashboard in four banner states via a test-env-only `/playwright/scenarios/:name` reseed route, MCP 401 page, re-auth success and failure (FakeClient scripted), trade review flow.
